      "text": "Five free lessons. A bigger learning journey.\n\nHi VeeAy! Today we're turning one big job-search challenge into practical steps you can actually use. Keep this guide handy and try the small activity at the end.\n\nUnderstand the role\n\nA virtual assistant may manage email, schedules, documents, research or customer communication. You don't need to learn every task; start with foundational habits.\n\nPractise communication\n\nWrite a short email confirming a meeting. Include the date, time zone, attendees and next action. Clear messages are a real workplace skill.\n\nBuild a useful system\n\nCreate a task tracker with Task, Owner, Deadline and Status. Keep it simple enough that someone else could understand it.\n\nREAL-WORLD EXAMPLE\n\nPractice message: 'Hi Alex, confirming our call on Thursday at 10 AM Manila time. I'll send the meeting link once everyone confirms. Thank you!'\n\nYOUR TINY WIN\n\nComplete one free Skills Lab activity today.\n\nVEEAYS PRO\n\nYour first five Skills Lab lessons are free. Want to continue through the complete 30-day roadmap? Unlock the remaining lessons with VeeAys Pro.\n\n₱499 / 30 days · No auto-renewal\n\nhttps://veeays.com/pro\n\nStart the free lessons\n\nhttps://veeays.com/va-skills-lab\n\nThe VeeAys Team\n\nVEEAYS WEB PORTAL SERVICE, 100 San Juan ACCFA, Cabanatuan City, Nueva Ecija, Philippines\n\nUnsubscribe from optional VeeAys emails: {{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}\n"
