      "text": "Your job search deserves a system.\n\nHi VeeAy! Today we're turning one big job-search challenge into practical steps you can actually use. Keep this guide handy and try the small activity at the end.\n\nFive minutes: Find\n\nScan roles that match your skills, location and preferred hours. Avoid scrolling endlessly.\n\nTen minutes: Prepare\n\nChoose one strong fit. Tailor a relevant résumé bullet and double-check the employer's instructions.\n\nFive minutes: Track\n\nRecord what you applied for, when, and your next step. This simple habit prevents missed follow-ups.\n\nREAL-WORLD EXAMPLE\n\nMONDAY: shortlist two roles. TUESDAY: tailor one application. WEDNESDAY: practise one VA skill. THURSDAY: review your tracker. FRIDAY: evaluate what's working.\n\nYOUR TINY WIN\n\nTry this routine once and adapt it to your schedule.\n\nVEEAYS PRO\n\nVeeAys Pro brings the full 30-day Skills Lab, eligible Résumé Studio editing and exports, saved jobs, application stages and notes, and follow-up reminders together for ₱499 / 30 days. No auto-renewal. No promise of employment—just practical tools to support your effort.\n\n₱499 / 30 days · No auto-renewal\n\nhttps://veeays.com/pro\n\nUnlock VeeAys Pro\n\nhttps://veeays.com/pro\n\nThe VeeAys Team\n\nVEEAYS WEB PORTAL SERVICE, 100 San Juan ACCFA, Cabanatuan City, Nueva Ecija, Philippines\n\nUnsubscribe from optional VeeAys emails: {{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}\n"
