      "text": "Clarity beats decoration.\n\nHi VeeAy! Today we're turning one big job-search challenge into practical steps you can actually use. Keep this guide handy and try the small activity at the end.\n\nLead with relevant facts\n\nUse clear headings, accurate dates and a concise summary. Put the experience most relevant to the role where it's easy to find.\n\nRewrite weak bullet points\n\nStart with an action. Add context and, if you know it, an outcome. Don't make up achievements or percentages.\n\nTailor to the role\n\nRead the listing and bring forward the skills you've actually used. Keep a copy of each version you submit.\n\nREAL-WORLD EXAMPLE\n\nBEFORE: 'Responsible for emails.' AFTER: 'Drafted weekly email updates and organized shared documents for a volunteer project.' Use this only if it reflects your real work.\n\nYOUR TINY WIN\n\nImprove two résumé bullets using truthful examples.\n\nVEEAYS PRO\n\nThis is where Pro becomes practical: active members can access eligible Résumé Studio editing and export features to prepare clearer application materials, alongside saved jobs and application tracking.\n\n₱499 / 30 days · No auto-renewal\n\nhttps://veeays.com/pro\n\nExplore Résumé Studio with Pro\n\nhttps://veeays.com/pro\n\nThe VeeAys Team\n\nVEEAYS WEB PORTAL SERVICE, 100 San Juan ACCFA, Cabanatuan City, Nueva Ecija, Philippines\n\nUnsubscribe from optional VeeAys emails: {{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}\n"
